  m_text: "<color=#9BE89B>public interface IInteractable\n{\n  string Prompt { get; }\n  void Interact(InteractorPlayer p);\n}</color>\n\n<color=#9BE89B>class Door : MonoBehaviour,\n             IInteractable</color>\n\n\uD50C\uB808\uC774\uC5B4 \uCABD:\n<color=#9BE89B>var it = hit.GetComponent\n  <IInteractable>();\nit?.Interact(this);</color>\n\n<color=#FF8A65>\uC5C6\uC73C\uBA74</color>: if (door) \u2026 else if (chest) \u2026\n\uC0C8 \uC885\uB958\uB9C8\uB2E4 \uD50C\uB808\uC774\uC5B4 \uCF54\uB4DC \uC218\uC815"
